# Source Of Truth

- Make code changes in Cursor only.
- Treat GitHub `main` as the source of truth for deploy environments.
- Deploy through Render from GitHub.
- Do not use Manus to edit code or migration journals.
- Before creating migrations, check existing migration numbers and use the next unused number.
- If a deploy environment has stale untracked files, delete only the specific stale files named by the error and pull from GitHub again.
